    {"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[
        {"@type":"Question","name":"What is D2C digital marketing and why does it matter for consumer brands?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"D2C (direct-to-consumer) digital marketing is the discipline of growing a consumer brand directly to the end customer — bypassing distributors, marketplaces and retail middlemen. It matters because D2C brands keep margins, own customer data, build first-party audiences for retention, and can move faster than traditional FMCG. We help 100+ India D2C brands scale across performance ads, SEO, social, content, influencer, email and WhatsApp with senior-led delivery."}},
        {"@type":"Question","name":"Which D2C industries do you specialise in?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Jewellery brands, food & beverage, hotels & hospitality, clothing & fashion, cosmetics & beauty, skincare & personal care, FMCG, lifestyle, home & décor, health & wellness, electronics & consumer products, and pure-play e-commerce & D2C brands. Each has its own customer journey, ad fatigue patterns and conversion economics — we adjust the playbook accordingly."}},
        {"@type":"Question","name":"What does a typical D2C marketing engagement look like?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Most engagements run as a monthly retainer combining (1) performance marketing across Google + Meta + Linkedin for paid traffic, (2) SEO + content for organic flywheel, (3) social media management for brand love + community, (4) influencer + creator partnerships for trust, (5) email + WhatsApp for retention and (6) CRO + analytics so every channel improves over time. Retainer ₹1.5L–₹6L/month + ad spend. We send a custom proposal in 48 hours of a 30-min discovery call."}},
        {"@type":"Question","name":"How are you different from other D2C marketing agencies?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Three things: (1) Senior-led delivery — no junior rotation; the strategist on the discovery call leads your account. (2) Full-funnel by default — most agencies are ads-only or content-only; we run the whole stack so brand + performance compound. (3) Honest reporting — ROAS, contribution margin, true MER on every dashboard, not just impressions. 100+ D2C brands scaled, Rs 8Cr+ in managed ad spend, 12+ years average team experience."}},
        {"@type":"Question","name":"What's your typical ROAS expectation for a D2C brand?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Honest answer: depends on category, basket size and brand maturity. Established jewellery + electronics brands often hit 4×–7× blended ROAS within 3 months. Fashion + cosmetics typically settle at 2×–4× blended (with strong creator + email retention pulling true MER higher). New brands without product-market fit will burn cash regardless of agency — we'll tell you upfront if we think the brand isn't ready, instead of taking the retainer."}}
